OL,3,GNEWSADecision to sell vacant 'eyesore' 
OL,4,Ato be discussed                        
OL,6,FA decision to sell a plot of land in   
OL,7,FBaildon which has been vacant since the
OL,8,Ftown's library building was demolished 
OL,9,Fis set to be discussed by councillors. 
OL,11,FIan Clough Hall - which housed the     
OL,12,Flibrary and other community facilities 
OL,13,F- was demolished in 2023, but the      
OL,14,Fplanned redevelopment of the site has  
OL,15,Ffailed to materialise.                 
OL,17,FBradford Council recently announced it 
OL,18,Fwould be selling the site, but         
OL,19,FConservative councillors David Ford and
OL,20,FDebbie Davies have "called in" the     
OL,21,Fdecision, meaning it would be debated. 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
