OL,3,GNEWSADecision to sell vacant 'eyesore' 
OL,4,Ato be discussed                        
OL,6,FFord said: "I am concerned about the   
OL,7,Floss of essential car parking and the  
OL,8,Flack of any progress on providing a    
OL,9,Fpermanent library of sufficient size in
OL,10,FBaildon."                              
